# Cursor Rule: ALOUTE Skills Integration

Before proposing or generating any code:
1. Always consult `skills/INDEX.md` to identify the owner file.
2. Read the designated owner file in `skills/`:
   - `skills/domain_system.md`: Domain, entity models, business rules, permissions, DB schema.
   - `skills/system_architecture.md`: Response format (`ApiResponse`), pagination, error handling.
   - `skills/aloute-openapi.yaml`: Exact OpenAPI spec — never invent custom endpoints or schemas.
   - `skills/backend_rule.md`: Spring Boot backend architecture, layers, JPA, transactions.
   - `skills/author_rule.md`: Spring Security, JWT, authentication, authorization.
   - `skills/frontend_rule.md`: Frontend Thymeleaf, Bootstrap, JavaScript.
   - `skills/docker_reverse_proxy_rule.md`: Docker and Nginx reverse proxy.
3. Adhere to: ONE RULE -> ONE OWNER -> ONE SOURCE OF TRUTH.
